Be aware that the firmware can't completely turn the radio off, it can only turn off the display and the RF chips etc, and put the CPU into a lower power mode. <br><br>However the radio will still consume around 50mA<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Wed Nov 20, 2024 11:43 pm</p><hr />
